# CODEOWNERS — default reviewer assignment for pull requests
#
# Velox has one maintainer today, so this only assigns the default
# reviewer. Review is not enforced: with one maintainer there is nobody
# else to approve, and pull requests merge on green checks. As
# contributors join, split ownership per domain and turn on required
# reviews.

